# Only Interface/AddOns and WTF settings are tracked; everything else in the game folder is ignored.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Interface/
/Interface/*
!/Interface/AddOns/
!/WTF/
# Keep out of the repo: login email/account list, console logs, caches, backups.
/WTF/Config.wtf
/WTF/SavedVariables/Blizzard_Console.lua*
*.bak
*.old
cache.md5
*.log
